<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερέγγῠος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγύη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>giving surety</i>:—hence, generally, <i>to
				be depended upon, trusty,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρούρημα, προστάται, σθένος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				449
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				797
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				87
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i>capable, sufficient,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ φ. εἰμι δύναμιν παρασχεῖν τοσαύτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμὴν φ. διασῶσαι τὰς νέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.49
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				396
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				470
			</span></i>: c. gen. rei, <i>warrant for</i> a thing, <i>able to
				answer for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί . . κελεύεις, ὧν ἐγὼ φ.;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					942
				</span></i>
			; <i>trusty</i> in face of danger, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰ δεινὰ φερεγγυώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.68
				</span></i>
			.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχέγγυος.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
